  :body "---\nnav: 15\ntype: experiment\nid: baseline_C6.4\nshort_name: baseline_top3_expand\ntitle: \"baseline_C6.4 — top-3 expand reproduce (R7/R8 reference)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: c\nround: r7\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_c__no_open3min]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.5108\ntrain_trade_count: 142\ntrain_win_rate: 0.9014\ntrain_sharpe: 9.0539\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0760\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0769\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: baseline\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist, baseline]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/c, round/r7, axis/whitelist, axis/baseline, status/baseline, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# baseline_C6.4 — top-3 expand (R7 reproduce reference)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— C6.4 的 R7 重跑作 R7 reference baseline。bit-for-bit 与 [[arc_260516a__team_c__C6.4__top3_expand]] 相同。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 不是 hypothesis，是 round reference reproduce —— R7 / R8 内所有 C7.x / C8.x 必须能 strict beat 这个 baseline。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- R7 runner 直接调 R6 logic; 输出 142 笔同 C6.4。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling stat。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.5108 | 142 | 9.05 | 90.1% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0760 ± 0.077 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- N/A (reproduce baseline)\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C6.4__top3_expand]]\n- **reference_for_round**: R7/R8 C7.x / C8.x candidates\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (baseline_C6.4)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 参见 [[arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] Notes —— \"round reference reproduce\" 是 C 队应当推广的好实践。\n"
